## Summary
India's largest IT consultancy, Tata Consultancy Services (TCS), has secured a $1.5 billion deal with German automaker Porsche. The partnership aims to leverage artificial intelligence to power the ongoing AI-led transformation of the automotive industry.

## Key Points
- TCS has signed a $1.5 billion deal with Porsche
- The deal centers on AI-driven digital transformation in the auto industry
- TCS is positioning itself as a major player in AI-led industry transformations
- This represents one of the significant AI-related deals between an Indian IT firm and a global automaker


